# Licensing of this repository

This repository is dual-licensed, per §7A of task card FTRO-WS-001 v0.3.

| Content | Licence | Files |
| --- | --- | --- |
| FTRO-authored software | Apache-2.0 | `src/**`, any executable script |
| FTRO-authored metadata, documents, manifests, graph metadata, certificates, ledgers, lab notes and reports | CC BY 4.0 | everything else authored here, including `phase0/**`, `ledgers/**`, `charter/**`, `profile/**`, `labnotes/**`, `*.md`, `*.json` |

Full texts: [LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt](LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt), [LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt](LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt).

## Provider content is NOT relicensed by inclusion

This repository is a **federation catalogue**. It records identifiers, checksums,
manifests, evidence pointers, access instructions and FTRO-authored analysis.
It does **not** redistribute provider source bytes, and inclusion here never
relicenses provider content.

Every referenced source retains its own licence, recorded in
[`ledgers/rights-ledger.md`](ledgers/rights-ledger.md). Two of the pilot sources
carry licences that are **not** interchangeable with the FTRO output licence:

- Zenodo 17107693 (optical) — **CC BY 4.0**
- PPTA DR3 (pulsar) — **CC BY-SA 4.0** (copyleft; see deficiency `FTRO-DEF-014`)

Retrieved provider bytes are cached under `data/raw/` and are excluded from version
control by `.gitignore`. Retrieval is reproducible from the pinned identifiers and
checksums using the scripts in `src/ftro/`.
